        {
          "text": "Mpawo Jehova wakaamba kuti, Muuya wangu tuukooyookazyanya lyoonse amuntu pe, nkaambo ninyama buyo. Mazuba aakwe ayooba myaka iili mwaanda amakumi obile. ",
