          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mboelede kubucita. Bulamfu bwabwaato buleelede kuba tukokola tuli myanda yotatwe, bwaamba bwabo bube tukokola tuli makumi osanwe, abwiime bwabo bube tukokola tuli makumi otatwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ucite impulunguzyo mubwaato, zibe kakokola komwe kuzwa kulululi, Awalo mulyango wabwaato uubike mulubazu lwabo. Alimwi yaka zimpetu zyaansi, azimwi zyabili zyakujulu, azimwi zyatatu kujulu lyazeezyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
